The license texts the app prints
================================

Settings > About > Open-source Licenses prints a full license text for every
entry above; the texts are embedded in
Apps/Enchron/Screens/OpenSourceLicenses.swift. Every one of them is
byte-identical to a document that exists. None is composed from parts,
abridged or reflowed, and this section records no departures. The byte count
and digest given for each is of the printed text followed by one newline, the
form in which the document is stored.

